Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\p1\an7\c&HF0F0F0&\pos(374.4,1086.4)\fscx266\fscy422}m 0 0 l 0 -275 l 434 -273 l 435 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(968.8,265.6)}冲绳研修旅行通知
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(969.2,330.4)}年度新人研修旅行地点定为冲绳。详情参考下记。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(970.8,404)}记
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(535.2,466)}1. 日期
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(586,516.4)}预计在四月末
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(539.2,588.4)}2. 地点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(707.6,638.4)}冲绳县读谷村  谢谢您嘞酒店
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,762)}本年度以新员工为对象的交流、营业、接待培训项目。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(567.6,712.4)}3.研修内容
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\bord60\pos(1803.2,641.2)}{\3c&HD8DADA&}333
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(836,847.6)}有关本活动的咨询，请联系人事部门负责人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1326.4,940.4)}以上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:14.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冲绳荞麦面  苦瓜豆腐炒肉  泡盛酒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:14.05,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,注：冲绳特色菜肴与本地产酒。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:16.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对了  还得去买泳衣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:19.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这可是新人「研修」旅行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:21.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我知道嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但晚上是自由活动时间诶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:29.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎  冬月小姐  要不要一起去买泳衣啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.27,0:00:37.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,又来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:38.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:48.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:50.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:56.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  我一想到研修旅行要去冲绳  就很担忧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:00:59.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,难道是怕冲绳太热了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:00.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:03.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,还是春天  应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,问题是我的内心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:10.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,内心？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:15.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,南国疗养地  蔚蓝大海  纯白沙滩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.01,0:01:20.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一见到这种景色  我就会过于激动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:23.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,然后把它变成寒冬里波涛汹涌的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想自己大概没法去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:32.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是这次又是研修旅行  不得不去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:35.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我到底该怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:39.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,虽然我也希望在南国的海滩边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.09,0:01:43.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能有随心所欲享受平静海浪声的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:52.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,肯定有办法能解决的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.33,0:01:55.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对吧  喵梅洛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:09.85,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1189.866,741.2)}第2话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:09.85,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fade(800,900)\pos(1358.666,814.399)}冲绳的海与心荡神驰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:15.42,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:15.42,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰凉的距离感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:21.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:21.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些许愁绪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:27.51,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:27.51,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}与一盏盏点亮的路灯遥相呼应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:33.36,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:33.36,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}觉察到心中一点点积攒的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:41.01,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:41.01,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是装酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:43.90,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:43.90,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像会被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.06,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.06,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,温柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:49.31,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:49.31,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,冻结一分钟 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:52.32,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:52.32,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:58.44,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:58.44,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想让你说  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:01.60,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:01.60,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,让我爱你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:04.63,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:04.63,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,说不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:12.62,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:12.62,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能说出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:29.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:37.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不介意的话  这个是我自己做的  给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:38.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:40.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你摇晃一下试试
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:45.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,海浪的声音？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:47.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是浪声鼓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:49.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,浪声鼓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:52.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  往里面加入沙子和豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:55.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,然后就能发出海浪声音的乐器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你可以用这个习惯海浪的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:05.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且听说海浪的声音能使内心平静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:07.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能让内心平静下来…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:10.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以  利用这个进行特训
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:13.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就算去看冲绳的海  也可能不会再下雪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:20.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生不来研修旅行  我会很寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:22.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你绝对要一起去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:25.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,再会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:31.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不不不  不行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:34.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,超喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:38.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不在就感到寂寞  这是真实存在的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:43.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,特训  在研修旅行前特训
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:44.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,特训？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:47.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你要在研修旅行的时候表演才艺吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:00.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,开始特训
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:10.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,放空大脑  接受本我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:14.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没问题的  一定没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:24.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛  你说冰室先生能顺利吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:33.60,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,畅快享受
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:33.60,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,冲绳观光指南
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:20.90,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,欢迎您嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是海诶  好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:34.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我感觉自己现在所向无敌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,结束啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.07,0:07:08.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说是已经到了晚上  但看起来跟白天一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这里天黑得晚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:13.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们出发去海边吧  海边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:23.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘛  毕竟还在四月
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:30.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,虽然我不习惯炎热的天气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:37.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但只要能避免日照  我倒不至于融化
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然天气热会融化啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,话说回来  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:49.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐给我的浪声鼓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:54.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,多亏每天晚上用鼓制造海浪声进行特训
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:57.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,现在才能心平气和地看海
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:08:01.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以  今天我绝对不会再下雪了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:06.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐是第一次来冲绳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:09.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是  高中修学旅行来过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:12.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,诶  挺好的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.71,0:08:15.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但遇上了台风  哪里都没去成
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,只能待在酒店
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.49,0:08:20.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:25.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以  我很期待这次旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:31.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我查了很多资料  自己做了旅游指南
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:33.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,旅游指南？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:35.03,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,冲绳研修旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:35.03,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,旅游指南
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生你要一份吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:41.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我就收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,做得超认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:52.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  虽然表面上完全看不出
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:56.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看来  她真的很期待这次旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:59.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐一起的这趟冲绳之旅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要尽情享受…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:05.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不妙  好险
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  偶尔会说关西腔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:11.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.67,0:09:22.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是收到了什么好消息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:24.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:31.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是宠物寄养人发给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:34.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样啊  帮忙在出门旅行时照看猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:39.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没错  是个好人  喵梅洛也十分亲近那位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:41.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,噢  是猫咪的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:42.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,名字
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:45.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的很可爱啊  喵梅洛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:48.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.23,0:09:52.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,超喜欢喵梅洛的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,诶  我的发音不对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:04.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真难啊  关西腔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:06.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,超可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:12.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我  我特喜欢冬月小姐这种地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好险
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:23.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,绝对要让这趟旅程风平浪静地结束
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:34.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,心情要平静
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:39.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要悠然  要安详…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:47.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,琉球狮子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:47.63,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,注：冲绳传统摆件。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,买一个最可爱的回去好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:53.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:11:00.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  那只就给冰室先生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.64,0:11:03.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没有  是冬月小姐更早看上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.02,0:11:06.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:07.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:09.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:15.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,作为交换  我们一起再选一只你的狮子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:23.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个  可爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:28.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,超可爱  你…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:31.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟  糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:33.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.81,0:11:38.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冲绳的春天会下雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是观光用的人工造雪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真漂亮  真是一生难忘的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:56.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:11:59.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不敢当
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:09.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好期待明天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.45,0:12:19.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这么  这么幸福真的没关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:27.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,接下来是天气预报环节
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:33.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天冲绳的天气从昨日的温和陡然转变
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,从早晨开始气温正不断上升
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:41.53,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\c&H692911&\pos(960,438)}m -844 -230 l 21 -230 l 72 -352 l -843 -354
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:41.53,Koori-picture4,,0,0,0,,{\blur50\pos(598,192)}有观测以来{\c&H4C00DE&}最热{\c&HF6F7F5&}的一天
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.02,0:12:41.53,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2D1EE0&\3c&HF1F3F6&\bord7\pos(286,780)}小心中暑!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:41.53,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2D1EE0&\3c&H5B5B6B&\bord10\pos(286,780)}小心中暑!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:41.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就这个季节来说  毫无疑问是有观测以来最热的酷暑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:54.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说什么酷暑  这可不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:55.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:57.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  没
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:12:59.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我去一趟小卖部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:04.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:06.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我先去吃早饭了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.77,0:13:09.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  这样不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:11.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要是酷暑真来了我会…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:20.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没  没有冰也没有冰激凌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:23.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不好意思  突然发生故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:26.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但到中午之前会修好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:28.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要真那样就来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:32.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好吧  请问酒店里有其他小卖部吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  就只有这里一家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:40.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们吃饱饱的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:46.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请问  冰室先生人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:51.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他啊  说要去趟小卖部就跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:52.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,之后就没见他人影
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:57.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他听了今天的天气预报  就突然很焦躁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.29,0:14:04.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你到底去了哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:09.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也不知道冰室先生的联系方式…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:12.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但只要能避免日照  我倒不至于融化
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:15.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天比昨天热太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:18.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他不会真的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:21.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在哪里  融化了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,或者可能因为天气热就待在酒店里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:29.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冷风？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:33.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:36.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐…我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:39.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在这…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.07,0:14:48.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:51.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你变小了好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:54.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太热了  我融化之后就会变小
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:58.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没想到会突然迎来酷暑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:03.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我本想用小卖部的冰块降温
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:05.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰柜却突然出了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:09.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样一来  也没法参加研修了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:14.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且  如果继续这样下去  我会一直不停融化…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:15.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,别怕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:19.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:21.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,只要给你降温就能复原了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:23.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:28.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我查了一下外面的便利店  最近的也在两公里…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:29.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:32.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:35.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:39.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,到便利店有两公里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:50.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:57.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,把这个吃了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:01.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你是怎么回来这么快的  便利店在…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:02.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是便利店买的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:05.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是早上自助餐的甜点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:09.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不愧是冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:11.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:13.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可以的  我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:30.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个…怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:32.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:34.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明明你一直比我高大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:37.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天却变得这么小  好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:40.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.99,0:16:44.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在一个成年男性听来或许不会开心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:46.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:54.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是  你可爱得让我想摸摸你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:56.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这  这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:00.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,让我摸摸头可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:03.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:15.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室君的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:19.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,凉丝丝的  好清爽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:29.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,变回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:31.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰棒起作用了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  非常感谢——
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:37.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:45.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我  我们得赶紧回去吃早饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:47.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说  说得也对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:52.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,当顾客说产品损坏的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对这样的顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.11,0:18:03.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,总感觉  面对往常的冰室先生更紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:06.97,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,…这种情况下一定会收到投诉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.08,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,要负起损坏的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:18.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女的后裔  在发烧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:24.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,各位新员工  大家研修辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:27.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,多吃点多喝点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:29.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那就让我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:31.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,干杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:46.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,研修旅行最棒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:50.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,虽然有一个遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:51.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,遗憾？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:59.99,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,烟花大会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:56.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天有烟花大会来着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:59.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,现在这个时间  已经抢不到好地方看了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:02.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我好想看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:08.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:14.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我们打个车回酒店吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:15.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:19.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不介意的话  我们稍微绕个路吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:21.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,绕路？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:30.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,比起绕路  这更像远足吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:31.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.41,0:19:33.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:35.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,马上就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:39.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:46.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:49.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  得亏你能找到这样的地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.10,0:19:52.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,制作旅游指南的时候找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:54.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,据说是当地的冷门景点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:03.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原来如此  真不愧是冬月小姐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:06.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,旅游指南吗  是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:10.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,快拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:16.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,大家也朝这边看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不知道拍得怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:46.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:51.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是那个时候的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:59.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这张照片  是仅属于我的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:12.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,希望明年  也能和冬月小姐一起看烟花
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:37.15,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:44.49,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:37.15,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,突然发觉之时  视线又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:44.49,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,突然发觉之时  视线又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.21,0:21:51.83,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:59.17,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.21,0:21:51.83,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,即使遇上坏事  心也如雨后初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:59.17,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,即使遇上坏事  心也如雨后初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:06.47,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:12.56,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:06.47,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,你的笑容为何  如此和煦温暖春风拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:12.56,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,你的笑容为何  如此和煦温暖春风拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.59,0:22:20.07,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.59,0:22:20.07,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  只要是关于你什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:27.16,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:27.16,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告诉我  你喜欢的事也好物也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:34.77,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:34.77,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  总会有一天我们的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.15,0:22:45.48,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.15,0:22:45.48,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,我无比期待着  它能一点一点日渐缩短
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.01,0:22:56.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,大家真是辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:23:00.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这次研修旅行圆满结束
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.18,0:23:03.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这真是一次最棒的研修旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:06.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐留下了超级棒的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.56,0:23:09.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,接下来我们要返回东京
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:13.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,回到东京之后  要和她创造更多更多的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.84,0:23:14.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一定会的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:18.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,至今为止大家的职位都是临时分配的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.07,0:23:21.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,之后终于要决定大家的最终分配去向了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.81,0:23:25.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,即使分配地点不一样了  大家的心还是在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:30.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好不容易关系搞好了  却可能要分散各地了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.73,0:23:31.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:33.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:38.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要和冬月小姐  分开了吗
